{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/1d63489446922c7a6368e07b26c49b69.avif?t=1758782477\" width=934 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the arena!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gorilla Showdown</i> is a chaotic, rhythm-fuelled, multiplayer brawler where you fight to control a dance pad in the middle of an arena \u2014 all while jamming out to musical mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, grapple, and bounce your way across crazy arenas with musical weapons, power-ups, and total monkey madness. Play with up to 12 friends or jump into public matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop now supported</strong> \u2013 Add and share custom music packs for a totally unique game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/76fd458f69075ef72abac81a124bb2aa.poster.avif?t=1758782477\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/76fd458f69075ef72abac81a124bb2aa.webm?t=1758782477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/76fd458f69075ef72abac81a124bb2aa.mp4?t=1758782477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/23cb2e062cb4de6e0e1b1fa5249e2a27.avif?t=1758782477\" width=934 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm meets mayhem in this musical King-of-the-Hill!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand on the dance pad to start racking up points \u2014 but you\u2019ll need to match the rhythm and survive the chaos around you. While you\u2019re dancing, others are doing everything they can to boot you off the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each round, new power-ups are loaded into the dance machine, making every match unpredictable. Fly through the air and laser your friends, launch missiles into the sky, or turn everything around you slow motion \u2014 every round tells a new story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/b7214abbb640c72883fd450a33e616e4.poster.avif?t=1758782477\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/b7214abbb640c72883fd450a33e616e4.webm?t=1758782477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/b7214abbb640c72883fd450a33e616e4.mp4?t=1758782477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/7354262b7e9e5a5901524138de4d27a4.avif?t=1758782477\" width=934 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or squad up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in private matches with friends or swing into public games for chaotic free-for-alls. The built-in proximity voice chat keeps the party vibe alive, whether you\u2019re teaming up or throwing bananas at each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes Available:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Classic Free-For-All</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Classic Teams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Infected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Payload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Banana Grab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Ape Arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <i>Horde Mode</i> \u2013 Coming Soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/fd27f95f420cab87fa05c79c70f3d178.poster.avif?t=1758782477\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/fd27f95f420cab87fa05c79c70f3d178.webm?t=1758782477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/fd27f95f420cab87fa05c79c70f3d178.mp4?t=1758782477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217900/extras/25b5c3d97b3a19a9f505fec17919f283.avif?t=1758782477\" width=934 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle across bizarre and colorful arenas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Plunder Point</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Menacing Mesa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Troubling Trenches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00